@startuml Manage Reservations Sequence

actor Admin
participant UI
participant ReservationController
participant ReservationService
participant ReservationRepository
database DB

Admin -> UI: Request reservations

UI -> ReservationController: GET /admin/reservations
activate ReservationController

ReservationController -> ReservationService: getAll()
activate ReservationService

ReservationService -> ReservationRepository: findAll()
activate ReservationRepository

ReservationRepository -> DB: SELECT all reservations
DB --> ReservationRepository: reservation rows

ReservationRepository --> ReservationService: List<Reservation>
deactivate ReservationRepository

ReservationService -> ReservationService: Map Reservation -> ReservationDto

ReservationService --> ReservationController: List<ReservationDto>
deactivate ReservationService

ReservationController --> UI: 200 OK\nList<ReservationDto>
deactivate ReservationController

UI --> Admin: Display reservations

ref over Admin, DB
    Cancel Reservation
    (see Cancel Reservation Sequence)
end ref

@enduml
